<title>UK: Commerzbank sets 100 million rand bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets 100 million rand bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.375    MATURITY    21.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.34    PAY DATE    21.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA-   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
